   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNEP ODSONET/SEAP 2001-2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">N&#xE4;tverket best&#xE5;r av statstj&#xE4;nstem&#xE4;n i 10 l&#xE4;nder i SO Asien, som samarbetar ang&#xE5;ende avvecklingen av ozonnedbrytande substanser. Insatsen avser st&#xF6;d till en regional n&#xE4;tverkskoordinat&#xF6;r stationerad p&#xE5; UNEPs kontor i Bangkok, en assistant samt anordnande av m&#xF6;ten i n&#xE4;tverket. Sv Naturv&#xE5;rdsverkests deltagande finansieras.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has since 1992 supported a network of officers in SE Asia that deal with the phase out of ozone depleting substances in their countries according to the Montreal Protocol. The proposal is to finance the network co-ordinator(UNEP regional office in Bangkok), netwrk meetings. Swedish Env Protection Agency prticipates in network</narrative>
  </description>
